# dim_date.sql uses dbt_utils.date_spine(), a real dbt package macro.
# Our sqlfluff setup deliberately uses the jinja templater (not the dbt
# templater) to avoid needing live Snowflake credentials in CI -- but that
# means it has no way to resolve namespaced dbt package macros like this
# one; it's not a bug in the file, it's a fundamental limitation of
# linting dbt SQL without a real dbt connection. This file's actual
# correctness is verified by `dbt build`/`dbt test` against real Snowflake
# (see docs/phase_3_summary.md), which is the check that actually matters
# here -- excluding it from sqlfluff rather than fighting the templater.
